Firstly, for data protection and GDPR compliance, we utilize encryption in transit via TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest using AES-256. We also employ key management through an EU-based infrastructure, ensuring that sensitive data is protected. Additionally, we support pseudonymisation and data minimisation, which are crucial for handling special category health data as per GDPR Article 9.

