Certification-wise, Faber IA is ISO 27001 certified since 2023, which covers the development, delivery, and operations of our services. This certification demonstrates our commitment to information security management. Additionally, we hold ISO 27701 certification, which extends our information security management system to include privacy information management, further supporting our ability to handle sensitive data securely.

In summary, with our existing certifications (ISO 27001 and ISO 27701), use of encryption, pseudonymisation, explainable AI outputs, non-automated decision-making process, and HDS certification through OuraneCloud, we are well-positioned to meet the security controls and compliance requirements outlined in the tender.
