Our solution provides drafting assistance for clinical and administrative content, such as discharge summaries and medical reports, ensuring that generated content is adapted to the clinical-administrative context and conforms to expected quality standards. The system supports medical coding (PMSI/ICD-10) for activity reporting (T2A) and takes into account dossier context where available.

